The Ashen Pact are six would-be-gods who stand watch over the world from a burning plain beyond it. They were first witnessed in a vision pried from the mind of a sleeping creature — six towering figures overlooking a city, seen in order: [[Regent]], [[Esoterica]], [[War]], [[Giant]], [[Herald]], and [[Pyre]].

They have offered no name of their own. Beneath the harmony of the song that draws sleepers into their fold, a single lyric repeats over and over — *ashen-packed* — and from it the witnesses coined the name that stuck.

What the Pact wants from the world below the [[Firmament]] is not yet known.
